{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MicrophysicsColumn",
    "description": "One sub-time step of the WSM6 microphysics of the EqWeather reference suite (WRF mp_physics = 6) assembled from the stage components in components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6, mounted by reference as top-level systems and coupled in the order mp_wsm6_run calls them with variable_map/param_to_var edges (esm-spec 10.4): WSM6Saturation (the start-of-sub-step qsat/rh/xl/cpm) -> WSM6MeltingFreezing (psmlt, pgmlt, pimlt, pihmf, pihtf, pgfrz as an in-place increment block, whose output IS the state at which the process rates are evaluated) -> WSM6WarmRain (praut, pracw, prevp) and WSM6ColdAccretion (the 11 collection terms) and WSM6IceDeposition (the sequential vapor budget pidep -> psdep -> pgdep -> pigen, psaut, pgaut, psevp, pgevp, opened by WarmRain's prevp) -> WSM6MassConservation (the budget rescaling and the state update it feeds) -> WSM6SaturationAdjustment (pcond at the updated state). Each stage keeps its `input_<x>` rewrite targets for standalone testing; here the mount-edge libraries couplings/tests/wsm6_couple_*_inputs.esm lower them to the stages' additive `<x>_in` coupling-target parameters, which the document's coupling fills from the upstream stage, including the parameters of the hydrometeor_slopes.esm subsystem `sd` that ColdAccretion, IceDeposition and MeltingFreezing mount (Cold.sd.qr_in and friends) and of the saturation.esm subsystem `sat` that SaturationAdjustment mounts. WHAT IS NOT IN THE CHAIN, and why: WSM6's sedimentation is not a rate. The kernel moves rain, snow, graupel and cloud ice with a semi-Lagrangian PLM update (nislfv_rain_plm/plm6) whose increment at the WRF sub-step differs from the donor-cell flux divergence that sedimentation.esm exposes by factors 0.4-1.6, with sign flips for snow and graupel; the two agree only in the dt -> 0 limit. There is therefore no rate that WSM6Sedimentation could hand to WSM6MeltingFreezing, and the chain starts one stage later: the post-sedimentation column state entering MeltingFreezing is a dumped profile (reconstructed from the dump's water and energy budgets, as in melting_freezing.esm's own tests), and everything downstream of it -- six of the seven stages of the sub-step -- is coupled. This is the largest sub-chain of the sub-step that is expressible as one coupled document. The other two dumped inputs are the vapor mixing ratio, the pressure and the density, which no stage of the chain changes (WSM6 updates q only in the mass-conservation block, whose own q_upd IS coupled onward into the saturation adjustment). The saturation stage is deliberately NOT recomputed downstream: WSM6 evaluates qsat, rh, xl and cpm once per sub-step from the START-of-sub-step temperature and vapor and keeps them while sedimentation, melting and freezing change t (FORTRAN_BUGS.md note N4), so WSM6Saturation is mounted on the entry state and its outputs are coupled into every later stage, exactly reproducing that staging. Nothing in the chain is rate x dt: the per-process limiters scale with 1/dtcld, the melting/freezing block and the saturation adjustment are instantaneous adjustments, and the mass-conservation factors are 1 only in the dtcld -> 0 limit (note N3), so the document is compared with the kernel at ITS sub-step (dtcld = 12 s) rather than replayed at a small dt. One document holds one column state (one regime); the mixed-phase companion is couplings/microphysics_column_mixed.esm. BLOCKED (EarthSciAST issue #311, 2026-09-12): this document does not load green on EarthSciAST main at or after #298. Four of the seven mounted stages -- Melt, Cold, IceDep and SatAdj -- carry a nested `sd` / `sat` subsystem ref (hydrometeor_slopes.esm, saturation.esm), and a mount-edge `expression_template_imports` injection no longer reaches a nested subsystem of the mounted leaf, so the `input_<x>()` rewrite targets inside it never lower to the `<x>_in` coupling-target parameters this document's variable_map param_to_var edges fill; every assertion fails with `unlowered_operator: input_T`. The three stages without a nested subsystem are unaffected. Neither a document-level nor a test-level import reaches the leaf, which `expand` seals at the mount, and `TemplateImport` has no way to name a scope inside it, so there is no fix available in this document: it needs either the upstream fix or the lowering library imported by hydrometeor_slopes.esm itself. The physics and the 40 reference values below are unchanged and were green before the update. Two older limitations are gone: a mounted component's inline tests no longer run under the coupling (#214), so a plain `./esm test` is now the right command and `--model` is no longer needed, and the leaves' index sets now merge into this document's registry (#261/#298), so they are no longer redeclared here. A parent test still cannot set a mounted component's parameter, so the sub-step length is prescribed in this model and coupled in.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["assembly", "coupling", "microphysics", "wsm6", "wrf"],
    "references": [
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., and J.-O. J. Lim (2006). The WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme (WSM6). J. Korean Meteor. Soc. 42, 129-151." },
      { "citation": "NCAR/MMM-physics mp_wsm6.F90 at commit 550b5b4 (WRF 4.8 phys/physics_mmm submodule)." }
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": { "type": "integer", "default": 40, "description": "Number of model layers of the dumped column (WRF kte = 40), bound into every mount edge whose leaf declares NLEV (Sat, Warm, Rescale; the other four take `lev` from the hydrometeor_slopes.esm or saturation.esm subsystem they mount). Since EarthSciAST #261/#298 a top-level ref mount merges the leaf's folded index_sets into this document's registry, so `lev` is no longer redeclared here." }
  },
  "models": {
    "Sat": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/saturation.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_column_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Melt": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/melting_freezing.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_column_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_melt_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Warm": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/warm_rain.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_warm_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Cold": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/cold_accretion.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_cold_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "IceDep": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/ice_deposition.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_icedep_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Rescale": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/mass_conservation.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_rescale_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "SatAdj": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/saturation_adjustment.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_pressure_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_satadj_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "MicrophysicsColumn": {
      "variables": {
        "dtcld0": { "type": "parameter", "units": "s", "default": 12.0, "description": "Prescribed: length of the WSM6 sub-time step (WRF dtcld = delt when delt <= dtcldcr)." },
        "dtcld": { "type": "unknown", "units": "s", "description": "Sub-step length as a variable, so that it can be coupled into every mounted stage (a parent test cannot set a mounted component's parameter, EarthSciAST issue #198)." },
        "xl_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "J/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.xl through the coupling." },
        "xl": { "type": "unknown", "units": "J/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Latent heat of vaporization at the start-of-sub-step temperature." },
        "cpm_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.cpm through the coupling." },
        "cpm": { "type": "unknown", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Moist heat capacity at the start-of-sub-step vapor." },
        "qsat_w_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.qsat_w through the coupling." },
        "qsat_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation mixing ratio over water at the start-of-sub-step state." },
        "rh_w_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.rh_w through the coupling." },
        "rh_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Relative humidity over water at the start-of-sub-step state." },
        "melt_T_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.T_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_T": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Temperature after the melting/freezing block, i.e. the state at which the process rates are evaluated (WSM6 t_rates)." },
        "melt_qc_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qc_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud water at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qc_rates)." },
        "melt_qi_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qi_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qi": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud ice at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qi_rates)." },
        "melt_qr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qr_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qr_rates)." },
        "melt_qs_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qs_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Snow at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qs_rates)." },
        "melt_qg_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qg_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qg": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Graupel at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qg_rates)." },
        "praut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.praut_lim through the coupling." },
        "praut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Autoconversion of cloud water to rain, after its own limiter (WSM6 praut_raw)." },
        "pracw_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.pracw_lim through the coupling." },
        "pracw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by rain (WSM6 pracw_raw)." },
        "prevp_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.prevp_lim through the coupling." },
        "prevp": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Evaporation/condensation of rain (WSM6 prevp_raw); also the term that opens the ice deposition budget." },
        "praci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.praci_lim through the coupling." },
        "praci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by rain (WSM6 praci_raw)." },
        "piacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.piacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "piacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by cloud ice (WSM6 piacr_raw)." },
        "psaci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.psaci_lim through the coupling." },
        "psaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by snow (WSM6 psaci_raw)." },
        "pgaci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.pgaci_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by graupel (WSM6 pgaci_raw)." },
        "psacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.psacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "psacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by snow (WSM6 psacr_raw)." },
        "pgacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.pgacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by graupel (WSM6 pgacr_raw)." },
        "paacw_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.paacw through the coupling." },
        "paacw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by the mixing-ratio-weighted mean snow/graupel distribution (WSM6 paacw_raw)." },
        "pidep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pidep_lim through the coupling." },
        "pidep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of cloud ice, first term of WSM6's sequential vapor budget (WSM6 pidep_raw)." },
        "psdep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.psdep_lim through the coupling." },
        "psdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of snow (WSM6 psdep_raw)." },
        "pgdep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pgdep_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of graupel (WSM6 pgdep_raw)." },
        "pigen_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pigen_lim through the coupling." },
        "pigen": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Nucleation of cloud ice from vapor, last term of the sequential vapor budget (WSM6 pigen_raw)." },
        "psaut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.psaut through the coupling." },
        "psaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of cloud ice to snow (WSM6 psaut_raw)." },
        "pgaut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pgaut_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of snow to graupel (WSM6 pgaut_raw)." },
        "prevp_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.prevp_final through the coupling." },
        "prevp_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain evaporation after the mass-conservation rescaling (WSM6 prevp_final)." },
        "piacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.piacr_final through the coupling." },
        "piacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by cloud ice after the rescaling (WSM6 piacr_final)." },
        "psacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.psacr_final through the coupling." },
        "psacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by snow after the rescaling (WSM6 psacr_final)." },
        "pgacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.pgacr_final through the coupling." },
        "pgacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by graupel after the rescaling (WSM6 pgacr_final)." },
        "psaci_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.psaci_final through the coupling." },
        "psaci_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by snow after the rescaling (WSM6 psaci_final)." },
        "pidep_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.pidep_final through the coupling." },
        "pidep_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ice deposition after the rescaling (WSM6 pidep_final)." },
        "T_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.T_upd through the coupling." },
        "T_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Temperature after the rate update, before the saturation adjustment (WSM6 t_upd)." },
        "qv_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qv_upd through the coupling." },
        "qv_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor after the rate update (WSM6 q_upd)." },
        "qc_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qc_upd through the coupling." },
        "qc_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud water after the rate update (WSM6 qc_upd)." },
        "qi_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qi_upd through the coupling." },
        "qi_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud ice after the rate update (WSM6 qi_upd)." },
        "qr_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qr_upd through the coupling." },
        "qr_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain after the rate update (WSM6 qr_upd)." },
        "qs_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qs_upd through the coupling." },
        "qs_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Snow after the rate update (WSM6 qs_upd)." },
        "qg_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qg_upd through the coupling." },
        "qg_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Graupel after the rate update (WSM6 qg_upd)." },
        "pcond_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives SatAdj.pcond through the coupling." },
        "pcond": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation-adjustment condensation/evaporation rate at the updated state, the last step of the sub-step (WSM6 pcond)." }
      },
